  (text "NOTES\nU9: -2 = active-low EN-bar (900k to VIN when off); KILL blanking 304-720 ms\nR30: gate = 0.53 x VSYS when off (<=9.7 V)\nC41: long-press force-off ~5.3 s\nJP3: close: power-on automatically when input appears (mast relay / C0 / T0)\nR31: AUTO-ON 7.10 V typ / 6.74 V min: above the 5 V buck EN max 6.55 V (review P1)\nR33: KILL high as soon as the Pi 3.3 V is up\nQ10: GPIO27 high (gpio-poweroff) -> power off\nR34: reboot: GPIO27 default pull-down keeps power on\nSW1: low-profile side button for the bench\nJ6: to the IP67 panel push-button\nD4: ESD for the panel button wire" (at 15 82.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 841c97c9-cc40-54b4-b7ad-0b2fa0daed08))
)
